Inclusion Criteria:

1. Age ≥ 18 y；
2. were proven newly diagnosed AL-CA by standard criteria;
3. subsequently received first-line therapies including anti-plasma cell therapy or targeted therapy;
4. must have given written informed consent (signed and dated) and any authorizations required by local law and be able to comply with all study requirements.

Exclusion Criteria:

1. received therapy with an approved treatment (e.g., Bortezomib, Daratumumab) prior to enrollment;
2. pregnancy or breastfeeding;
3. severe claustrophobia;
4. any condition deemed by the investigator to interfere with study results or increase participant risk.
